# Unreal Engine 5 project (AstheticDrive/)
# Only source files and content are tracked: Source/, Config/, Content/, the .uproject.
# Everything below is generated and is rebuilt by the engine / Visual Studio.

# Generated project folders
AstheticDrive/Binaries/
AstheticDrive/Build/
AstheticDrive/DerivedDataCache/
AstheticDrive/Intermediate/
AstheticDrive/Saved/

# Plugin build output
AstheticDrive/Plugins/**/Binaries/
AstheticDrive/Plugins/**/Intermediate/

# Visual Studio / Rider generated files
AstheticDrive/.vs/
AstheticDrive/*.sln
AstheticDrive/*.slnx
AstheticDrive/*.xcodeproj
AstheticDrive/*.xcworkspace
AstheticDrive/UpgradeLog*.htm
AstheticDrive/UpgradeLog*.XML
AstheticDrive/_UpgradeReport_Files/
.idea/
*.suo
*.user
*.userosscache
*.sdf
*.opensdf
*.VC.db
